	(671, '3.7.3', '3.7.3 - Key-management policies and procedures are implemented to include secure storage...', 'Key-management policies and procedures are implemented to include secure storage of cryptographic keys used to protect stored account data.', 'PCI DSS v4.0', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', 1, 'Requirement 3', NULL, '2026-01-06 19:50:13.556114', '2026-01-06 19:50:13.556114', NULL, 'Determine if equipment to be removed from organizational spaces for off-site maintenance is sanitized of any CUI.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(673, '3.7.5', '3.7.5 - Key management policies procedures are implemented to include the retirement, re...', 'Key management policies procedures are implemented to include the retirement, replacement, or destruction of keys used to protect stored account data, as deemed necessary when:
