	(1, 'CVE-2005-4366', '6.4', 'AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:N', '"[]"', 'Multiple SQL injection vulnerabilities in DRZES HMS 3.2 allow remote attackers to execute arbitrary SQL commands via the (1) plan_id parameter to (a) domains.php, (b) viewusage.php, (c) pop_accounts.php, (d) databases.php, (e) ftp_users.php, (f) crons.php, (g) pass_dirs.php, (h) zone_files.php, (i) htaccess.php, and (j) software.php; (2) the customerPlanID parameter to viewplan.php; (3) the ref_id parameter to referred_plans.php; (4) customerPlanID parameter to listcharges.php; and (5) the domain parameter to (k) pop_accounts.php, (d) databases.php, (e) ftp_users.php, (f) crons.php, (g) pass_dirs.php, (h) zone_files.php, (i) htaccess.php, and (j) software.php.  NOTE: the viewinvoice.php invoiceID vector is already covered by CVE-2005-4137.', '2005-12-20 00:03:00', '2025-04-02 23:03:51.193', '"[\"cpe:2.3:a:fad_solutions:drzes_hms:3.2:*:*:*:*:*:*:*\"]"', '"[{\"url\":\"http://pridels0.blogspot.com/2005/11/drzes-hms-32-multiple-vuln.html\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21179\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21180\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21181\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21182\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21183\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21184\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21185\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21186\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21187\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21188\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21189\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21190\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21191\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.osvdb.org/21192\",\"