', 'Logging and Monitoring', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Logging and Monitoring\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(644, 4, 'LOG-03', 'Security Monitoring and Alerting', 'Identify and monitor security-related events within applications
and the underlying infrastructure. Define and implement a system to generate
alerts to responsible stakeholders based on such events and corresponding metrics.
', 'Logging and Monitoring', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Logging and Monitoring\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(645, 4, 'LOG-04', 'Audit Logs Access and Accountability', 'Restrict audit logs access to authorized personnel and maintain records
