there is a change in the threat environment.
', 'Logging and Monitoring', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Logging and Monitoring\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(649, 4, 'LOG-08', 'Log Records', 'Generate audit records containing relevant security information.
', 'Logging and Monitoring', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Logging and Monitoring\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(650, 4, 'LOG-09', 'Log Protection', 'The information system protects audit records from unauthorized access,
modification, and deletion.
', 'Logging and Monitoring', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Logging and Monitoring\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(651, 4, 'LOG-10', 'Encryption Monitoring and Reporting', 'Establish and maintain a monitoring and internal reporting capability
