', 'Logging and Monitoring', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Logging and Monitoring\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(655, 4, 'SEF-01', 'Security Incident Management Policy and Procedures', 'Establish, document, approve, communicate, apply, evaluate and maintain
policies and procedures for Security Incident Management, E-Discovery, and Cloud
