internal departments, impacted CSCs, and other business critical relationships
(such as supply-chain) that may be impacted.''
', 'Security Incident Management, E-Discovery, & Cloud Forensics', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Security Incident Management, E-Discovery, & Cloud Forensics\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(676, 4, 'STA-14', 'Supply Chain Data Security Assessment', 'Define and implement a process for conducting security assessments
periodically for all organizations within the supply chain.
', 'Supply Chain Management, Transparency, and Accountability', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Supply Chain Management, Transparency, and Accountability\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(658, 4, 'SEF-04', 'Incident Response Testing', 'Test and update as necessary incident response plans at planned intervals
