', 'Security Incident Management, E-Discovery, & Cloud Forensics', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Security Incident Management, E-Discovery, & Cloud Forensics\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(663, 4, 'STA-01', 'SSRM Policy and Procedures', 'Establish, document, approve, communicate, apply, evaluate and maintain
