', 'Supply Chain Management, Transparency, and Accountability', '"{\"controlDomain\":\"Supply Chain Management, Transparency, and Accountability\"}"', '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033', 'not_implemented', 'applicable', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-12-28 14:03:40.959033'),
	(667, 4, 'STA-05', 'SSRM Documentation Review', 'Review and validate SSRM documentation for all cloud services offerings
