Ex3: Monitor the performance of restored systems to verify the adequacy of the restoration', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(668, '3.6.3', '3.6.3 - Test the organizational incident response capability....', 'Test the organizational incident response capability.', 'NIST 800-171', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', 1, 'Incident Response', NULL, '2026-01-06 19:50:13.274171', '2026-01-06 19:50:13.274171', NULL, 'Determine if the incident response capability is tested.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
