	(508, 'GV.SC-01', 'Cybersecurity Supply Chain Risk Management', 'Cybersecurity risk management is integrated into the organization’s supply chain management processes.', 'NIST CSF 2.0', 'Unassigned', 'Annual', 'Document', 'active', 1, 'Govern', NULL, '2025-12-20 09:07:31.20323', '2025-12-20 09:07:31.20323', 'Cybersecurity Supply Chain Risk Management', 'Ex1: Establish a strategy that expresses the objectives of the cybersecurity supply chain risk management program
