	(3271, '1.2.3', '**Verify that** training datasets are encrypted in transit and at rest, using industry-standard cryptographic algorithms and key management practices.', '**Verify that** training datasets are encrypted in transit and at rest, using industry-standard cryptographic algorithms and key management practices.', 'OWASP AISVS (AI Security)', NULL, 'Annual', 'Document', 'active', 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-04 23:43:26.765987', '2026-02-04 23:43:26.765987', NULL, '**C1.2 Training Data Security & Integrity**

