	(799, 7, 58, '1.2.3', 'Verify that the application uses a single vetted authentication mechanism that is known to be secure, can be extended to include strong authentication, and has sufficient logging and monitoring to detect account abuse or breaches.', 'Verify that the application uses a single vetted authentication mechanism that is known to be secure, can be extended to include strong authentication, and has sufficient logging and monitoring to detect account abuse or breaches.', '**V1.2 Authentication Architecture**

When designing authentication, it doesn''t matter if you have strong hardware enabled multi-factor authentication if an attacker can reset an account by calling a call center and answering commonly known questions. When proving identity, all authentication pathways must have the same strength.', '"[\"ASVS\",\"L1\",\"L2\"]"', '2026-02-04 23:54:44.65554', '2026-02-04 23:54:44.65554'),
	(800, 7, 58, '1.2.4', 'Verify that all authentication pathways and identity management APIs implement consistent authentication security control strength, such that there are no weaker alternatives per the risk of the application.', 'Verify that all authentication pathways and identity management APIs implement consistent authentication security control strength, such that there are no weaker alternatives per the risk of the application.', '**V1.2 Authentication Architecture**

