	(852, 7, 59, '2.2.6', 'Verify replay resistance through the mandated use of One-time Passwords (OTP) devices, cryptographic authenticators, or lookup codes.', 'Verify replay resistance through the mandated use of One-time Passwords (OTP) devices, cryptographic authenticators, or lookup codes.', '**V2.2 General Authenticator Security**

