	(792, 7, 58, '1.1.3', 'Verify that all user stories and features contain functional security constraints, such as "As a user, I should be able to view and edit my profile. I should not be able to view or edit anyone else''s profile"', 'Verify that all user stories and features contain functional security constraints, such as "As a user, I should be able to view and edit my profile. I should not be able to view or edit anyone else''s profile"', '**V1.1 Secure Software Development Lifecycle**

