	(972, 7, 63, '6.3.2', 'Verify that random GUIDs are created using the GUID v4 algorithm, and a Cryptographically-secure Pseudo-random Number Generator (CSPRNG). GUIDs created using other pseudo-random number generators may be predictable.', 'Verify that random GUIDs are created using the GUID v4 algorithm, and a Cryptographically-secure Pseudo-random Number Generator (CSPRNG). GUIDs created using other pseudo-random number generators may be predictable.', '**V6.3 Random Values**

True Pseudo-random Number Generation (PRNG) is incredibly difficult to get right. Generally, good sources of entropy within a system will be quickly depleted if over-used, but sources with less randomness can lead to predictable keys and secrets.', '"[\"ASVS\",\"L1\",\"L2\"]"', '2026-02-04 23:59:56.342752', '2026-02-04 23:59:56.342752'),
	(973, 7, 63, '6.3.3', 'Verify that random numbers are created with proper entropy even when the application is under heavy load, or that the application degrades gracefully in such circumstances.', 'Verify that random numbers are created with proper entropy even when the application is under heavy load, or that the application degrades gracefully in such circumstances.', '**V6.3 Random Values**

