	(1011, 7, 66, '9.2.3', 'Verify that all encrypted connections to external systems that involve sensitive information or functions are authenticated.', 'Verify that all encrypted connections to external systems that involve sensitive information or functions are authenticated.', '**V9.2 Server Communication Security**

