	(1023, 7, 67, '13.2.5', 'Verify that REST services explicitly check the incoming Content-Type to be the expected one, such as application/xml or application/json.', 'Verify that REST services explicitly check the incoming Content-Type to be the expected one, such as application/xml or application/json.', '**V13.2 RESTful Web Service**

