If traditional models are still in place, then manual steps must be taken to harden and back up that configuration to allow the compromised systems to be quickly replaced with high integrity, uncompromised systems in a timely fashion.

Compliance with this section requires an automated build system, and access to build and deployment scripts.', '"[\"ASVS\",\"L1\",\"L2\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:00:12.98853', '2026-02-05 00:00:12.98853'),
	(1110, 8, 76, 'MASVS-AUTH-3', 'The app secures sensitive operations with additional authentication.', 'Some additional form of authentication is often desirable for sensitive actions inside the app. This can be done in different ways (biometric, pin, MFA code generator, email, deep links, etc) and they all need to be implemented securely.', NULL, '"[\"MASVS\",\"Authentication and Authorization\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:28:53.267592', '2026-02-05 00:28:53.267592'),
	(1104, 8, 126, 'MASVS-STORAGE-1', 'Sensitive Data Storage', 'Verify that sensitive data is not stored insecurely on the device.', NULL, '"[\"MASVS\",\"Storage\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:28:51.815289', '2026-02-05 00:28:51.815289'),
	(1105, 8, 126, 'MASVS-STORAGE-2', 'Log Sanitization', 'Verify that sensitive data is not leaked through system logs.', NULL, '"[\"MASVS\",\"Storage\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:28:52.023156', '2026-02-05 00:28:52.023156'),
	(1106, 8, 127, 'MASVS-CRYPTO-1', 'Key Management', 'Verify that cryptographic keys are managed securely using platform features (Keystore/Keychain).', NULL, '"[\"MASVS\",\"Cryptography\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:28:52.33361', '2026-02-05 00:28:52.33361'),
	(1107, 8, 127, 'MASVS-CRYPTO-2', 'Strong Algorithms', 'Verify that only industry-standard, strong cryptographic algorithms are used.', NULL, '"[\"MASVS\",\"Cryptography\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:28:52.541116', '2026-02-05 00:28:52.541116'),
	(1108, 8, 128, 'MASVS-AUTH-1', 'Secure Authentication', 'Verify that authentication is performed securely and follows best practices.', NULL, '"[\"MASVS\",\"Authentication and Authorization\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:28:52.852645', '2026-02-05 00:28:52.852645'),
	(1109, 8, 128, 'MASVS-AUTH-2', 'Biometric Authentication', 'Verify that biometric authentication is implemented using platform-recommended APIs.', NULL, '"[\"MASVS\",\"Authentication and Authorization\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:28:53.062625', '2026-02-05 00:28:53.062625'),
	(1111, 8, 129, 'MASVS-NETWORK-1', 'TLS Configuration', 'Verify that all network communication is performed over a secure, up-to-date TLS connection.', NULL, '"[\"MASVS\",\"Network Communication\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:28:53.582161', '2026-02-05 00:28:53.582161'),
	(1203, 18, 136, 'OSPS-DO-02', 'Standard License', 'Verify that the project uses a standard, OSI-approved open source license.', 'Implementation guidance for Standard License based on OpenSSF OSPS Baseline.', NULL, '2026-02-06 10:08:20.879596', '2026-02-06 10:08:20.879596'),
	(1204, 18, 137, 'OSPS-VM-01', 'Dependency Scanning', 'Verify that the project uses automated tools to detect vulnerable dependencies.', 'Implementation guidance for Dependency Scanning based on OpenSSF OSPS Baseline.', NULL, '2026-02-06 10:08:21.354164', '2026-02-06 10:08:21.354164'),
	(1205, 18, 137, 'OSPS-VM-02', 'Vulnerability Remediation SLA', 'Verify that a process exists for remediating security issues within a defined timeframe.', 'Implementation guidance for Vulnerability Remediation SLA based on OpenSSF OSPS Baseline.', NULL, '2026-02-06 10:08:21.580387', '2026-02-06 10:08:21.580387'),
	(1034, 7, 68, '14.2.1', 'Verify that all components are up to date, preferably using a dependency checker during build or compile time. ()', 'Verify that all components are up to date, preferably using a dependency checker during build or compile time. ()', '**V14.2 Dependency**

Dependency management is critical to the safe operation of any application of any type. Failure to keep up to date with outdated or insecure dependencies is the root cause of the largest and most expensive attacks to date.

Note: At Level 1, 14.2.1 compliance relates to observations or detections of client-side and other libraries and components, rather than the more accurate build-time static code analysis or dependency analysis. These more accurate techniques could be discoverable by interview as required.', '"[\"ASVS\",\"L1\",\"L2\",\"L3\",\"CWE-1026\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:00:13.476953', '2026-02-05 00:00:13.476953'),
