	(1043, 7, 68, '14.4.1', 'Verify that every HTTP response contains a Content-Type header. Also specify a safe character set (e.g., UTF-8, ISO-8859-1) if the content types are text/*, /+xml and application/xml. Content must match with the provided Content-Type header.', 'Verify that every HTTP response contains a Content-Type header. Also specify a safe character set (e.g., UTF-8, ISO-8859-1) if the content types are text/*, /+xml and application/xml. Content must match with the provided Content-Type header.', '**V14.4 HTTP Security Headers**

', '"[\"ASVS\",\"L1\",\"L2\",\"L3\",\"CWE-173\"]"', '2026-02-05 00:00:15.689379', '2026-02-05 00:00:15.689379'),
	(1044, 7, 68, '14.4.2', 'Verify that all API responses contain a Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="api.json" header (or other appropriate filename for the content type).', 'Verify that all API responses contain a Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="api.json" header (or other appropriate filename for the content type).', '**V14.4 HTTP Security Headers**

