	(150, 'CVE-2025-53967', '8', 'CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N', '"[\"CWE-420\"]"', 'Framelink Figma MCP Server before 0.6.3 allows an unauthenticated remote attacker to execute arbitrary operating system commands via a crafted HTTP POST request with shell metacharacters in input that is used by a fetchWithRetry curl command. The vulnerable endpoint fails to properly sanitize user-supplied input, enabling the attacker to inject malicious commands that are executed with the privileges of the MCP process. Exploitation requires network access to the MCP interface.', '2025-10-08 17:15:34.507', '2025-10-08 19:38:09.863', '"[]"', '"[{\"url\":\"https://github.com/GLips/Figma-Context-MCP/blob/96b3852669c5eed65e4a6e20406c25504d9196f2/src/utils/fetch-with-retry.ts#L34\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/GLips/Figma-Context-MCP/releases/tag/v0.6.3\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.imperva.com/blog/another-critical-rce-discovered-in-a-popular-mcp-server/\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"}]"', '"{\"id\":\"CVE-2025-53967\",\"sourceIdentifier\":\"cve@mitre.org\",\"published\":\"2025-10-08T17:15:34.507\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-08T19:38:09.863\",\"vulnStatus\":\"Awaiting Analysis\",\"cveTags\":[],\"descriptions\":[{\"lang\":\"en\",\"value\":\"Framelink Figma MCP Server before 0.6.3 allows an unauthenticated remote attacker to execute arbitrary operating system commands via a crafted HTTP POST request with shell metacharacters in input that is used by a fetchWithRetry curl command. The vulnerable endpoint fails to properly sanitize user-supplied input, enabling the attacker to inject malicious commands that are executed with the privileges of the MCP process. Exploitation requires network access to the MCP interface.\"}],\"metrics\":{\"cvssMetricV31\":[{\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\",\"type\":\"Secondary\",\"cvssData\":{\"version\":\"3.1\",\"vectorString\":\"CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N\",\"baseScore\":8,\"baseSeverity\":\"HIGH\",\"attackVector\":\"ADJACENT_NETWORK\",\"attackComplexity\":\"HIGH\",\"privilegesRequired\":\"NONE\",\"userInteraction\":\"NONE\",\"scope\":\"CHANGED\",\"confidentialityImpact\":\"HIGH\",\"integrityImpact\":\"HIGH\",\"availabilityImpact\":\"NONE\"},\"exploitabilityScore\":1.6,\"impactScore\":5.8}]},\"weaknesses\":[{\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\",\"type\":\"Secondary\",\"description\":[{\"lang\":\"en\",\"value\":\"CWE-420\"}]}],\"references\":[{\"url\":\"https://github.com/GLips/Figma-Context-MCP/blob/96b3852669c5eed65e4a6e20406c25504d9196f2/src/utils/fetch-with-retry.ts#L34\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/GLips/Figma-Context-MCP/releases/tag/v0.6.3\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.imperva.com/blog/another-critical-rce-discovered-in-a-popular-mcp-server/\",\"source\":\"cve@mitre.org\"}]}"', '2026-01-12 11:29:26.084', '2026-01-13 11:29:26.084'),
