                <h2 style="font-size: 24px; color: #2d3748; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Key Objectives & Milestones Timeline</h2>
                
                <p style="margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: italic; color: #2d3748;">This section outlines the critical objectives and milestones that Intellfence must achieve to ensure compliance and enhance operational maturity within the cybersecurity landscape. By strategically aligning these goals with industry standards, Intellfence can effectively fortify its defenses and maintain a robust security posture.</p>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: #2d3748; margin-bottom: 15px;">Strategic Objectives</h3>
                    <ul style="padding-left: 20px; color: #4a5568;">
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Establish governance framework</li><li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Implement key controls</li><li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Achieve target compliance score</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: #2d3748; margin-bottom: 15px;">Target Timeline</h3>
