                <h2 style="font-size: 24px; color: #2d3748; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">KPIs & Success Metrics</h2>
                <div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568;">
